      "value": "Duplicate of:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/ability-to-change-join-status-by-friend-favorite-group\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/set-social-status-per-friend-favorite-group",
