  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, the ability to set favourite friends only serves an organisational purpose, but it would be incredibly useful to be able to show a different join status for different people!\n\na common complaint i hear is that most users are on orange 99% of the time, this isent due to these users not wanting to socalise on a social platfrom but due to wanting to limit who can join at a specific time but with the introduction of favroite friends we could easily set per friend group statuses, i know this feature would be widly enjoyed and allow for more interaction across the platform.\n\nI have made a small ui mock up for how I'd imagine the ui change could be implemented with the current \n\ni am never on green or blue for this exact reason i have too many people I friended that id like to be able to recognise if i run into them again, but wouldn't want joining me for a chill night when im just with some close friends\n\nim sure a system like this would require some effort to change how statuses are displayed but i think it would be worth it to provide a significantly improved user experience!",
